{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310121001:0":{"text":"우음, 맛있어. 조금 더 먹고 싶은데...","source_cn":"好香啊，还想再吃一点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BA297950C3A96AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310121002:0":{"text":"팔라모르 씨의 음식 솜씨가 이렇게 좋을 줄이야! 게다가 약초도 제대로 넣어 끓여 낸 수프는 아주 상큼하고 달콤한 냄새까지 나!","source_cn":"没想到法拉莫尔先生的厨艺这么棒！而且他还很会用草药，炖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA72BD6249287FAF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310121003:0":{"text":"그러게. 나도 약초는 연구해 보았는데, 이렇게 약초와 음식을 배합했던 적은 없었어...","source_cn":"的确，我也研究过草药，可是从来没试过像这样把草药和食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x502591E55533E90C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310121004:0":{"text":"팔라모르 씨는 분명 박식한 와일더스 전사일 거야.","source_cn":"法拉莫尔先生一定是位知识渊博的绿裔战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8B18C905BAB82B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}